WEBVTT

00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:04.250
Students attending Happo.

00:00:04.620 --> 00:00:08.080
Regarding the adults'
 betrayal of democracy...

00:00:08.120 --> 00:00:12.120
So they have student protests
 at high schools too now?

00:00:12.160 --> 00:00:14.500
They don't block up the grounds.

00:00:14.540 --> 00:00:17.540
But young people don't hide
 being superhumans.

00:00:18.620 --> 00:00:20.620
Here's what you asked for.

00:00:21.950 --> 00:00:23.250
Thank you.

00:00:23.620 --> 00:00:25.910
It must be hard for
 people from that side.

00:00:25.950 --> 00:00:28.500
The medicine here
 doesn't work for colds.

00:00:28.660 --> 00:00:31.290
It's from listening to that
 dumb radio all night.

00:00:31.330 --> 00:00:33.160
You can't come out.

00:00:33.370 --> 00:00:36.410
I've heard from your mother.
 Master Ullr, right?

00:00:37.830 --> 00:00:40.290
You know about it, Mr. Nagakawa?

00:00:40.500 --> 00:00:42.910
That I'm from the Demon's World?

00:00:43.290 --> 00:00:47.250
Yes. You're looking for
 a contract partner in this world.

00:00:47.290 --> 00:00:49.000
In other words, a husband.

00:00:49.040 --> 00:00:50.870
You'll be a leader of
 the Demon's World.

00:00:52.040 --> 00:00:53.250
Good luck.

00:00:56.250 --> 00:00:58.370
Um, aren't you scared?

00:00:58.540 --> 00:01:00.120
Of us.

00:01:02.410 --> 00:01:05.160
You people use human joy as power.

00:01:05.580 --> 00:01:08.250
That means a superhuman of justice.

00:01:16.870 --> 00:01:19.720
I didn't know people studied
 the Demon World.

00:01:20.200 --> 00:01:22.970
Yes. You can get advice from him.

00:01:23.750 --> 00:01:25.950
(December, the 42nd of Shinka Era
 Tokyo)

00:01:39.540 --> 00:01:42.700
Concrete Revolutio
 ~Superhuman Phantasmagoria~

00:01:47.080 --> 00:01:51.500
I heard it
 A voice cursing fate

00:01:52.330 --> 00:01:55.660
I found it
 A way to use my power

00:01:55.950 --> 00:01:59.500
What you want are not words,
 are they?

00:01:59.750 --> 00:02:02.830
That love inside
 I want to send it on

00:02:03.470 --> 00:02:05.620
Justice is not on my side

00:02:05.600 --> 00:02:10.000
The only thing absolute for me
 is myself

00:02:11.000 --> 00:02:12.520
Come on Wakers. Ready, go!

00:02:12.540 --> 00:02:17.500
Protecting the illusions
 that somebody dreamed of

00:02:17.830 --> 00:02:22.000
will liberate the stagnant sky

00:02:22.660 --> 00:02:27.660
We hurl our unanswerable cries
 at each other

00:02:27.950 --> 00:02:32.500
And they become the reason we live

00:02:33.330 --> 00:02:38.160
What can I do in this
 hopeless world we live in?

00:02:38.630 --> 00:02:43.330
Only those that keep searching

00:02:43.680 --> 00:02:46.160
can become the future

00:02:46.290 --> 00:02:50.160
Start the revolution!

00:02:56.040 --> 00:02:58.030
(August, the 43rd of Shinka Era
 Hokkaido)

00:02:58.580 --> 00:03:01.030
You're saying Claude did all this?

00:03:01.620 --> 00:03:02.700
Kikko...

00:03:02.750 --> 00:03:05.450
...or Hoshino, was acting strange.

00:03:05.750 --> 00:03:08.250
So we hurried over from Tokyo.

00:03:08.620 --> 00:03:09.580
But.

00:03:10.080 --> 00:03:14.040
She's a witch.
 There's no telling what she'll do.

00:03:14.790 --> 00:03:15.790
Witch...

00:03:15.910 --> 00:03:20.200
Excuse me. I'm Taki of the Strange
 Power Risk Management Office.

00:03:20.540 --> 00:03:21.790
This is Takahara.

00:03:22.080 --> 00:03:23.700
We're commissioned by the police.

00:03:23.750 --> 00:03:27.060
We investigate crimes
 abusing magic and science.

00:03:43.370 --> 00:03:47.910
I just fixated a moment
 that left a deep impact in space.

00:03:47.950 --> 00:03:49.410
Just some basic magic.

00:03:50.370 --> 00:03:53.910
What did Claude have
 against these doctors and nurses?

00:04:18.160 --> 00:04:20.650
All these corpses seem
 to be superhumans.

00:04:20.910 --> 00:04:22.200
Superhumans?

00:04:22.790 --> 00:04:25.160
They were used for experiments here?

00:04:25.790 --> 00:04:30.660
They'd received the same operations
 as the "Antares" crew.

00:04:31.000 --> 00:04:33.540
Claude heard about that
 from somewhere.

00:04:33.580 --> 00:04:36.410
He came to get revenge
 for the superhumans.

00:04:36.750 --> 00:04:39.420
But still. This cannot be forgiven.

00:04:39.950 --> 00:04:41.040
Of course not.

00:04:43.950 --> 00:04:45.660
Where's Mr. Jaguar?

00:04:45.870 --> 00:04:48.540
He's guarding Councilor Mitsuya.

00:04:48.790 --> 00:04:53.580
The one who used superhumans
 as virtual enemies in war simulation.

00:04:54.660 --> 00:04:57.650
Why are we guarding such a person?

00:04:58.450 --> 00:05:02.830
Laws to expand the rights of
 superhumans are on the table now.

00:05:02.870 --> 00:05:04.950
Sir Mitsuya is for it.

00:05:05.250 --> 00:05:06.910
A political maneuver.

00:05:07.370 --> 00:05:11.410
He probably wants to centralize
 the management of superhumans.

00:05:11.580 --> 00:05:13.410
But he's still in favor.

00:05:13.580 --> 00:05:17.750
But he did research on how to
 suppress superhumans by force.

00:05:17.830 --> 00:05:21.500
Compared to him, Claude cares
 a lot more about superhumans.

00:05:30.580 --> 00:05:31.540
Kikko!

00:05:33.120 --> 00:05:35.270
Did something happen with Claude?

00:05:36.620 --> 00:05:39.440
Senpai, why won't you tell me?

00:05:41.450 --> 00:05:45.240
You can at least tell me
 how you really feel.

00:05:58.410 --> 00:05:59.750
Where's Kikko?

00:05:59.790 --> 00:06:01.620
You still had that picture?

00:06:01.950 --> 00:06:03.700
Emi, who is he?

00:06:06.290 --> 00:06:09.830
Oh, right. You don't remember
 anything from then, do you?

00:06:12.910 --> 00:06:15.250
That boy is Jin.

00:06:15.500 --> 00:06:16.540
Jin.

00:06:17.080 --> 00:06:18.250
Where is he?

00:06:18.330 --> 00:06:19.790
He's dead.

00:06:19.830 --> 00:06:20.790
He was killed.

00:06:21.500 --> 00:06:22.540
By who?

00:06:23.080 --> 00:06:24.320
Rainbow Knight.

00:06:28.410 --> 00:06:30.950
Remember what Yumihiko
 of Team BL said?

00:06:31.120 --> 00:06:35.950
It wasn't just Daitetsu that was
 kidnapped by Rainbow Knight.

00:06:39.370 --> 00:06:42.040
Quiet, Jiro-san. A guest is here.

00:06:42.830 --> 00:06:46.130
Prying into the Daitetsu Incident
 after all this time?

00:06:47.120 --> 00:06:49.330
Just between you and me.

00:06:49.540 --> 00:06:51.390
Consider it a warning.

00:06:53.000 --> 00:06:55.330
Are you saying that he's Claude?

00:06:55.790 --> 00:06:59.120
There's no use in us
 getting at each other's throats.

00:06:59.160 --> 00:07:03.040
We were both called superhumans once.

00:07:04.950 --> 00:07:06.080
Jiro.

00:07:06.250 --> 00:07:07.950
You haven't met before.

00:07:08.330 --> 00:07:10.250
This is Mr. Yoshiaki Satomi.

00:07:10.450 --> 00:07:12.500
I owe him a lot from before the war.

00:07:12.540 --> 00:07:17.000
Right now, I work as an advisor
 for Teito Advertisement Inc.

00:07:17.040 --> 00:07:18.660
Just an old geezer.

00:07:19.040 --> 00:07:20.120
Teito Advertisement?

00:07:20.450 --> 00:07:21.750
Sorry to have bothered you.

00:07:23.620 --> 00:07:27.840
Teito Advertisement is behind Claude.
 That's how the Bureau sees it.

00:07:28.250 --> 00:07:34.040
These days, what's most important is
 selling images, not products.

00:07:34.080 --> 00:07:35.600
Call them fantasies if you like.

00:07:36.250 --> 00:07:41.100
We're going to launch an image of
 superhumans that everybody loves.

00:07:46.250 --> 00:07:47.620
How do you know him?

00:07:49.450 --> 00:07:53.620
I researched superhumans
 at Ikuta Laboratory before the war.

00:07:54.080 --> 00:07:58.120
He led the superhuman missions
 over at the continents.

00:07:58.580 --> 00:08:00.620
Your conversation just now...

00:08:01.250 --> 00:08:02.750
Is it related to this?

00:08:05.950 --> 00:08:08.950
Why, if it isn't Jin.
 Brings back memories.

00:08:09.290 --> 00:08:11.080
Do you remember him, Jiro?

00:08:11.160 --> 00:08:12.620
This is no laughing matter.

00:08:12.910 --> 00:08:16.080
I had such a friend,
 but until just now...

00:08:16.580 --> 00:08:17.640
I'd forgotten.

00:08:17.830 --> 00:08:19.580
And you're thinking now.

00:08:20.080 --> 00:08:22.640
That Claude might be Jin.

00:08:23.370 --> 00:08:25.000
But Jin died, right?

00:08:25.330 --> 00:08:26.660
That's what I heard.

00:08:27.750 --> 00:08:30.250
He would've been
 a year older than you.

00:08:30.410 --> 00:08:32.150
You two were so close.

00:08:35.910 --> 00:08:38.160
I meant to have Jiro come to Sapporo.

00:08:39.700 --> 00:08:40.790
That witch will...

00:08:41.750 --> 00:08:43.660
be a power that protects you.

00:08:44.290 --> 00:08:46.120
But I want Jiro to understand.

00:08:46.660 --> 00:08:48.080
That won't be long.

00:08:49.040 --> 00:08:51.250
Come, it's about time.

00:08:51.450 --> 00:08:54.200
I've leaked the information
 to the U.S. Army.

00:08:55.330 --> 00:08:56.750
Galboi Riker.

00:08:57.540 --> 00:08:59.160
I hope you make it.

00:09:07.940 --> 00:09:10.660
I don't show on a radar
 and they ambush me?

00:09:14.450 --> 00:09:16.040
Master Ultima.

00:09:22.000 --> 00:09:23.790
Were you all okay?

00:09:23.910 --> 00:09:27.210
The Iron-Masked Swordsman
 saved us again.

00:09:27.950 --> 00:09:29.950
Where were you, Mr. Matsutaro?

00:09:30.120 --> 00:09:33.130
You're always gone when we need you.

00:09:33.500 --> 00:09:36.660
But who can
 the Iron-Masked Swordsman be?

00:09:37.450 --> 00:09:41.080
Forgive me. I cannot let you
 know my true identity.

00:09:41.500 --> 00:09:42.540
Because...

00:09:43.330 --> 00:09:46.450
I cannot let you know
 my true identity.

00:09:46.790 --> 00:09:48.160
- Because...
 - Hoshinoko.

00:09:48.450 --> 00:09:49.870
Hoshinoko.

00:09:50.290 --> 00:09:51.330
Oh, yes?

00:09:52.000 --> 00:09:54.660
Do you think that Jiro is Claude?

00:09:56.250 --> 00:09:57.830
Of course not.

00:09:58.700 --> 00:09:59.740
But...

00:10:00.200 --> 00:10:01.660
Just maybe.

00:10:02.830 --> 00:10:07.080
He's wearing a mask because
 he needs to hide his identity.

00:10:07.830 --> 00:10:09.790
The other day, Senpai...

00:10:11.500 --> 00:10:13.170
He doesn't mind those.

00:10:13.500 --> 00:10:16.000
He even seemed to like it.

00:10:22.330 --> 00:10:25.080
(Science Lab)

00:10:29.500 --> 00:10:30.580
Miss Witch Girl.

00:10:31.620 --> 00:10:32.950
You're...

00:10:34.040 --> 00:10:36.330
You're the Supernatural Kicker, right?

00:10:36.830 --> 00:10:38.290
You were here before.

00:10:38.580 --> 00:10:40.080
Friends with Nagakawa?

00:10:40.120 --> 00:10:42.250
That's "Mr. Nagakawa" for you.

00:10:43.410 --> 00:10:46.410
But he's more like a student
 than a teacher.

00:10:48.540 --> 00:10:51.120
I heard about Claude at Yokosuka.

00:10:51.450 --> 00:10:52.830
I'd been thinking.

00:10:53.450 --> 00:10:56.950
That maybe superhumans
 can do something greater.

00:10:57.620 --> 00:10:59.450
It's not a fantasy, either.

00:10:59.790 --> 00:11:02.290
So you want to talk to him?

00:11:02.790 --> 00:11:03.910
I don't know.

00:11:04.120 --> 00:11:06.700
But instead of hiding identities

00:11:06.750 --> 00:11:10.620
and just fighting gangs
 and Space Monsters...

00:11:22.910 --> 00:11:24.120
Is that...?

00:11:25.250 --> 00:11:26.620
Galboi Riker?

00:11:30.330 --> 00:11:34.460
There were sightings of a superhuman
 crashing into Happo High School.

00:11:34.950 --> 00:11:38.910
All the witnesses said it was
 Galboi Riker they'd see on TV.

00:11:38.950 --> 00:11:41.090
Galgal... Who's that again?

00:11:41.910 --> 00:11:43.450
Galboi Riker.

00:11:43.500 --> 00:11:46.720
The first superhuman pilot to achieve
 space flight in flesh.

00:11:47.370 --> 00:11:50.350
He can travel with speed using
 gravity and magnetism.

00:11:50.750 --> 00:11:53.370
Unlike Master Ultima who's part-alien,

00:11:53.500 --> 00:11:56.040
Galboi is a pure
 Earth-born superhuman.

00:11:56.160 --> 00:12:00.080
He went against orders to attack
 enemy countries from space.

00:12:00.200 --> 00:12:03.990
"The Earth is so beautiful that all
 superhumans would risk their life."

00:12:04.160 --> 00:12:06.450
Those are words from
 his famous speech.

00:12:08.580 --> 00:12:11.370
Sounds like what that
 Claude guy says...

00:12:12.540 --> 00:12:14.330
Did I screw up again?

00:12:15.790 --> 00:12:19.200
Galboi was demoted to the training
 center. Why is he in Japan?

00:12:19.250 --> 00:12:20.630
So he's Claude?

00:12:20.910 --> 00:12:21.950
Impossible.

00:12:22.250 --> 00:12:25.370
But he might be
 communicating with Claude.

00:12:25.500 --> 00:12:26.950
I don't want to believe it.

00:12:27.540 --> 00:12:31.950
That such a great superhuman
 had anything to do with that criminal.

00:12:34.370 --> 00:12:35.500
Yes, hello.

00:12:37.120 --> 00:12:39.290
A lockout at Happo High School?

00:12:39.750 --> 00:12:43.330
What's going on?
 Hand over the superhuman that crashed.

00:12:43.370 --> 00:12:45.450
No dogs of the state allowed in here.

00:12:45.750 --> 00:12:47.530
What, school autonomy?

00:12:47.530 --> 00:12:50.200
A Russian speaking student
 heard from Galboi.

00:12:50.250 --> 00:12:53.040
The Self Defense Force and
 Master Ultima shot him down.

00:12:55.910 --> 00:12:57.450
I wanted to save...

00:12:58.910 --> 00:13:00.050
the superhumans.

00:13:01.330 --> 00:13:03.250
Before everything disappeared...

00:13:04.700 --> 00:13:06.700
A comrade called me...

00:13:07.540 --> 00:13:08.930
to come here...

00:13:13.370 --> 00:13:14.440
He's dead.

00:13:17.370 --> 00:13:18.310
A comrade?

00:13:18.950 --> 00:13:20.410
Who's that?

00:13:21.080 --> 00:13:22.370
That would be me.

00:13:27.910 --> 00:13:29.120
Misterious-Sword Claude.

00:13:30.120 --> 00:13:33.040
This construction site
 is great for hiding.

00:13:33.500 --> 00:13:37.080
We'd promised to meet here if
 something happened to Galboi.

00:13:37.290 --> 00:13:39.950
You called him to come to Japan?

00:13:40.700 --> 00:13:42.040
He wanted to see it.

00:13:42.790 --> 00:13:45.370
The tragic superhumans
 on the "Antares".

00:13:45.450 --> 00:13:47.620
The Hokkaido hospital experiments.

00:13:47.700 --> 00:13:50.790
The tie connecting those incidents.
 The answer.

00:13:50.950 --> 00:13:52.890
What is your intention?

00:13:53.790 --> 00:13:56.200
For peace. For freedom.

00:13:57.000 --> 00:13:58.330
And for justice.

00:13:59.160 --> 00:14:03.540
Superhumans are supposed to exist
 to bring peace to this world.

00:14:04.330 --> 00:14:06.870
But in reality, they're used for wars.

00:14:07.000 --> 00:14:08.410
Stripped of freedom.

00:14:09.290 --> 00:14:11.500
None are free to act for justice.

00:14:11.790 --> 00:14:13.870
You too, Kikko Hoshino.

00:14:15.540 --> 00:14:17.660
You have wonderful powers.

00:14:18.370 --> 00:14:20.420
You wish to save someone.

00:14:21.540 --> 00:14:23.450
There's no need to hold back.

00:14:23.660 --> 00:14:25.830
It's time to show your true soul.

00:14:34.200 --> 00:14:35.930
Miss Hoshino?

00:14:40.700 --> 00:14:42.690
Stop. My son is innocent.

00:14:43.120 --> 00:14:44.660
Don't worry.

00:14:44.700 --> 00:14:48.070
We're just recovering
 the foreign plane that crashed.

00:14:52.500 --> 00:14:54.700
Some superhumans too, huh?

00:14:54.870 --> 00:14:57.700
Are you sure?
 Your parents don't know, right?

00:14:57.750 --> 00:14:59.500
Stop! They're just kids.

00:15:01.870 --> 00:15:02.790
Hitoyoshi.

00:15:02.830 --> 00:15:05.040
Raise your head, Equus!

00:15:16.870 --> 00:15:18.200
Supernatural Kicker?

00:15:18.660 --> 00:15:20.660
Where's Galboi Riker?

00:15:21.080 --> 00:15:22.520
What will you do to him?

00:15:22.700 --> 00:15:28.280
Shelter him. He has violated airspace,
 but we'll talk to the Ministry and...

00:15:28.500 --> 00:15:31.660
We can't trust you adults anymore.

00:15:40.700 --> 00:15:43.170
But you'll trust Claude?

00:15:43.660 --> 00:15:46.290
He's trying to teach us the truth.

00:15:46.540 --> 00:15:48.420
We're not kids anymore.

00:15:49.620 --> 00:15:50.660
Claude!

00:15:59.620 --> 00:16:00.620
Kikko?

00:16:00.830 --> 00:16:02.870
I'll protect you, Jiro-san.

00:16:05.790 --> 00:16:07.820
What are you saying? I'm Jiro.

00:16:11.120 --> 00:16:13.370
Does she think that Claude is me?

00:16:14.790 --> 00:16:19.450
No matter how much Claude cares
 for superhumans, he's an enemy.

00:16:19.500 --> 00:16:20.580
I can't let him run free.

00:16:20.790 --> 00:16:24.330
Jiro-san said what I'd
 wanted him to say.

00:16:24.750 --> 00:16:27.590
He did what I'd wanted him to do.

00:17:13.290 --> 00:17:16.550
Where are you taking him?
 Galboi is mankind's treasure.

00:17:18.750 --> 00:17:21.330
Please, explain to him.

00:17:23.200 --> 00:17:26.620
Galboi violated airspace
 over the Ogasawara Islands.

00:17:27.120 --> 00:17:30.620
The Master and Self-Defense
 Force shot him down on patrol.

00:17:30.660 --> 00:17:31.870
Ogasawara?

00:17:32.040 --> 00:17:34.700
Why was the Master there? An ambush?

00:17:35.040 --> 00:17:39.000
Enough of me. Take down
 Misterious-Sword Claude, Bureau folk.

00:17:39.330 --> 00:17:41.700
Let him run free and
 a war will break out.

00:17:42.250 --> 00:17:44.660
Is that what you want?

00:17:47.250 --> 00:17:49.080
You found out what Claude wants?

00:17:49.700 --> 00:17:54.500
We found that the doctors at Sapporo
 were at the Ikuta Lab before the war.

00:17:54.620 --> 00:17:55.590
Ikuta?

00:17:56.200 --> 00:17:59.340
The superhuman research lab
 Prof. Hitoyoshi was at.

00:17:59.750 --> 00:18:03.160
After the war, some researchers
 were taken to the U.S

00:18:03.200 --> 00:18:05.660
and continued their research.

00:18:05.830 --> 00:18:10.330
The homeport for the "Antares" was at
 Bonin Island of the Ogasawara Islands.

00:18:10.410 --> 00:18:11.620
Ogasawara?

00:18:11.660 --> 00:18:16.450
It was U.S. territory until
 it was returned to Japan this June.

00:18:16.830 --> 00:18:21.370
If there was a U.S.-Japan joint
 superhuman research lab there...

00:18:23.040 --> 00:18:26.790
Galboi Riker was headed
 straight towards Bonin Island.

00:18:27.370 --> 00:18:29.750
He might've been on to something.

00:18:30.290 --> 00:18:34.000
We're just here to reveal the truth.

00:18:37.750 --> 00:18:40.390
He says he can smell her in there.

00:18:40.910 --> 00:18:44.370
But it's strange.
 He says he feels something scary.

00:18:44.830 --> 00:18:46.020
Stay here.

00:18:49.520 --> 00:18:54.750
Yes. You announced that all
 the kidnapped kids had died.

00:18:54.790 --> 00:18:56.410
Everybody but Daitetsu.

00:18:56.500 --> 00:18:58.410
But they were alive.

00:18:58.540 --> 00:19:00.290
They were sent to the island.

00:19:00.700 --> 00:19:02.410
You knew, didn't you?

00:19:03.830 --> 00:19:07.910
Rainbow Knight kidnapped
 many young people and children.

00:19:08.750 --> 00:19:10.620
But he was really sheltering them.

00:19:10.910 --> 00:19:14.250
He tried to save us from
 being sent to Ogasawara.

00:19:16.080 --> 00:19:19.500
Then why did you say that
 he demanded a ransom?

00:19:20.000 --> 00:19:23.790
To make it look like
 he did it for the money, right?

00:19:24.290 --> 00:19:25.580
Rainbow Knight?

00:19:25.750 --> 00:19:27.930
He didn't demand a ransom?

00:19:27.930 --> 00:19:32.580
You wrote it all off by setting him up
 as a dangerous superhuman.

00:19:33.040 --> 00:19:34.950
I saw it all happening.

00:19:42.200 --> 00:19:46.790
The Rainbow Knight threatened
 to expose you kids' existence.

00:19:47.080 --> 00:19:50.290
That kids were used
 for superhuman experiments.

00:19:50.870 --> 00:19:55.160
We'd been thinking we need an
 organization to protect superhumans.

00:19:55.370 --> 00:19:56.870
This was our chance.

00:19:57.160 --> 00:20:00.830
If the legendary Rainbow Knight was
 actually a criminal,

00:20:01.080 --> 00:20:03.390
the state would want
 to control superhumans.

00:20:04.250 --> 00:20:07.750
It was a necessary sacrifice
 for founding the Bureau.

00:20:08.910 --> 00:20:10.000
You killed him?

00:20:11.160 --> 00:20:13.160
You set him up as a kidnapper.

00:20:13.660 --> 00:20:15.080
You killed him.

00:20:15.250 --> 00:20:16.290
Father!

00:20:16.410 --> 00:20:17.330
Jiro?

00:20:17.370 --> 00:20:18.790
Answer me, Father!

00:20:24.080 --> 00:20:27.000
Rainbow Knight was no kidnapper.

00:20:27.620 --> 00:20:28.620
Yet...

00:20:28.700 --> 00:20:30.330
Is it you, Jin?

00:20:33.870 --> 00:20:36.500
I go by Jin Nagakawa now.

00:20:37.700 --> 00:20:41.010
I'll be honest. I hardly remember you.

00:20:41.870 --> 00:20:43.540
You were quite shocked.

00:20:43.950 --> 00:20:48.080
You were made to believe that
 your hero was a kidnapper.

00:20:48.700 --> 00:20:50.950
And he was killed
 in front of your eyes.

00:20:51.370 --> 00:20:55.020
Would I have become like you?

00:20:55.500 --> 00:20:58.770
I guess so. If Prof. Hitoyoshi
 hadn't adopted you...

00:20:59.410 --> 00:21:03.780
You would've been taken to Ogasawara,
 got ripped apart at the lab...

00:21:04.250 --> 00:21:06.120
had your soul pried into...

00:21:06.620 --> 00:21:09.500
fused with machines,
 animals, viruses...

00:21:10.120 --> 00:21:12.790
even other superhumans...

00:21:13.370 --> 00:21:15.250
to have your power drawn out.

00:21:24.500 --> 00:21:26.830
And now, look what I can do.

00:21:31.410 --> 00:21:34.040
The Bureau doesn't
 protect superhumans.

00:21:34.500 --> 00:21:35.440
Jiro!

00:21:36.080 --> 00:21:37.150
Boss, it's dangerous.

00:21:37.370 --> 00:21:38.540
You, Akita.

00:21:38.580 --> 00:21:40.620
It's all my responsibility.

00:21:40.910 --> 00:21:44.790
I was just so desperate about
 making the Superhuman Bureau.

00:21:44.830 --> 00:21:45.750
Boss.

00:21:45.790 --> 00:21:46.910
Believe me.

00:21:47.370 --> 00:21:51.030
I wanted to protect superhumans
 for this planet.

00:21:51.450 --> 00:21:52.830
For this planet?

00:21:53.370 --> 00:21:56.500
You think I don't know what you are?

00:22:21.120 --> 00:22:25.370
They're freaks from outer space.

00:23:56.750 --> 00:24:01.160
Fumers. Beings that break down their
 bodies and traveled into outer space.

00:24:01.160 --> 00:24:02.950
That is what I am.

00:24:03.000 --> 00:24:07.750
I have been searching for beings
 that would evolve to be like us.

00:24:07.790 --> 00:24:11.010
On this planet,
 they are called superhumans.
